{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:47:709","content":{"id":709,"title":"组合","content":[{"children":[{"text":"题目描述","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"e4a7105b-8ab6-45c7-9da5-29e31e32f9f9","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"给定两个整数 n 和 k，返回 1 ... n 中所有可能的 k 个数的组合。","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"168ae6a7-c4c4-42af-b752-884090bb5f64","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"text":"示例：","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"40b56270-9369-4c13-9cfd-1161f1cdf0a0","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"输入: n = 4, k = 2\n输出:\n[\n  [2,4],\n  [3,4],\n  [2,3],\n  [1,2],\n  [1,3],\n  [1,4],\n]","collabId":"6473cac8-6488-445c-bfdd-43d4f9eda0e0","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"c0c7f23e-c7f6-4c34-82e1-462612a60b23","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"e1f7e763-64d3-4634-a069-5b9359e9ee64"},{"children":[{"text":"解题思路","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"63d64542-21f1-43ea-bd37-146296700c17","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"text":"将 1 ~ n 想成是一棵树的根节点的 n 个子节点，每个节点下面还有 n 个子节点，总共有 k 层，我们遍历这颗树寻找一个组合，因为在遍历节点 i 时，我们已经考虑了包含节点 i 的所有组合，在后续遍历的过程中就不必考虑节点 i","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"4bb95fa6-ae10-4c08-9a88-199b26645fda","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"code":"class Solution {\n    private List<List<Integer>> res = new ArrayList<>();\n    private int n;\n    private int k;\n    public List<List<Integer>> combine(int n, int k) {\n        if (n < k) {\n            return res;\n        }\n\n        this.n = n;\n        this.k = k;\n\n        combine(0, new ArrayList<>());\n        return res;\n    }\n\n    public void combine(int start, ArrayList<Integer> path) {\n        // path.size() == k 表示已经收集了 k 个元素\n        if (path.size() == k) {\n            res.add(new ArrayList<>(path));\n            return;\n        }\n        // 从 start + 1 处开始遍历，因为 start 之前的元素已经考虑过了\n        for (int i = start + 1; i <= n - (k - path.size()) + 1; i++) {\n            path.add(i);\n            combine(i, path);\n            // 回到上一级节点时，从路径中删除该元素\n            path.remove(path.size() - 1);\n        }\n    }\n}","collabId":"0bf0dade-dd37-474d-815e-47e23d1919f2","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","type":"code-step"}],"collabId":"a498df84-1a97-4e41-ad32-062a866c65ae","language":"java","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","type":"code-block","uuid":"5e4d86e4-dbf3-4343-a05b-d0456b3e48c7"},{"children":[{"text":"参考","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"629c7ab8-8319-4c10-857c-7c87220ea674","level":2,"tauContract":"1b84ef07e920f55d81fccc0601a84826fcd79bf3ee62a898f19b0af7592aa283","type":"header"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"text":"组合","type":"formatted"}],"collabId":"5c6fe54a-91bb-472a-901e-f7277076af41","openEdit":false,"tauContract":"ebf1d56e356279ad64279a16e90d9b28280f70eac20d5071950fc0c4b5c364a6","type":"link","url":"https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/combinations/"}],"collabId":"10563794-a818-4ddb-9aee-f280f819b4d9","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","type":"paragraph"}],"collabId":"4eabb7a0-f56c-4eb5-9b3b-625c0169157f","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","type":"list-item"}],"collabId":"7326a796-1120-409b-9521-ae87242e1c94","tauContract":"b74d37e5bfbf2503c151b31f93763a8fb42e80426564246cbb0af72201a60e8c","type":"bulleted-list"}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"LeetCode","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:718","type":"doc","id":718}},{"label":"深度优先遍历"},{"label":"组合","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:709","type":"doc","id":709}}],"prevPage":{"title":"子集","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:708","type":"doc","id":708}},"nextPage":{"title":"组合总数","target":{"key":"doc:project:47:710","type":"doc","id":710}},"createTime":1729002230408,"updateTime":1793532544507,"projectId":47},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1793532544507}}